  <name>Antigravity</name>
  <summary>Next-generation agentic desktop application and IDE by Google</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      Antigravity is Google's advanced agentic coding environment and IDE.
      It combines deep code intelligence, agentic pair-programming workflows,
      and seamless developer toolchain integration.
    </p>
    <p>Key features include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Autonomous agentic workflows for software engineering tasks</li>
      <li>Integrated Language Server protocol and code intelligence</li>
      <li>Chrome DevTools MCP integration for web and UI debugging</li>
      <li>Deep system and workspace integration with Wayland and X11 support</li>
      <li>Automated updates and seamless Flatpak sandboxing</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">com.google.Antigravity.desktop</launchable>

